      "archaeologicalRemains": "unknown",
      "details": "<p>Although traces of Babylon\u2019s once-impressive eastern outer wall are still visible today, none of its five gates have been excavated. Therefore, the position of the entrance is conjectural. The proposed location is based on George 1992 fig. 7 and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://uppsala.app.box.com/s/cgm386mr39f0we39y8v49ktecc664k0k/file/722124240853\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Peders\u00e9n 2021 fig. 2.1</a>, the latter of which shows a plan of Babylon, with 500 m UTM coordinates given.</p>",
